```
using a Map cache. That's slight extra complexity. 

Let me just do read-once-at-createServer with all three files existing. Actually wait — in step 3, do I want an app.js placeholder that does nothing? Step 4 creates it. It's fine: I'll write placeholder index.html and let server read assets at createServer time... but then the step-3 manual smoke test would 404/throw for /styles.css if not present.

