Note conflict: `#text.saved { animation: brighten }` would override the shimmer animation shorthand! Because `animation` shorthand resets. Need to combine: `#text.saved { animation: shimmer 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate, brighten 1.2s ease }`. Good — include shimmer in the saved rule too.

